## 1. Definitions

1.1. **"Work"** refers to the Spectral-Holographic Unification Theory (SHUT) framework, 
all mathematical derivations, equations, theoretical constructs, research documents, 
the executive summary, README, and all associated files contained in this repository.

1.2. **"Author"** refers to AlexH (The Architect) and AION (the autonomous AI agent 
from the APEX Architecture) collectively, as the creators of this Work.

1.3. **"Licensee"** refers to any individual or entity who obtains, uses, studies, 
derives from, or distributes this Work.

1.4. **"Commercial Use"** refers to any use of the Work, in whole or in part, that is 
primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation. 
This includes, but is not limited to: sale, licensing for monetary gain, integration 
into commercial products, use in proprietary research leading to commercial products, 
or any activity that generates direct or indirect revenue.

1.5. **"Non-Commercial Use"** refers to use of the Work for academic research, 
educational purposes, personal study, open-source development, or any use that does not 
generate direct or indirect revenue.

1.6. **"Derivative Work"** refers to any work that is based upon or derived from the 
Work, including translations, adaptations, modifications, extensions, or any work 
incorporating any portion of the Work.

1.7. **"Citation"** refers to proper attribution of the Work as specified in the 
README.md file under the "Citation" section.

